# The schemas the C nightly fuzzer reads. They are the table corpus the
# Makefile's own generate targets read (make/c.mk, tables_generate_c): every
# table shape the C emitter can produce — value tables, fixed tables, graph
# tables, block, block-home, messages, stream, blobs, scalars, maps, lists,
# arms, backend/vocab messages, wide text, and the test/tables evolution
# fixtures. Paths are relative to the repository root; one schema per line.
tables/examples
tables/pointers
tables/block
tables/blockhome
tables/messages
tables/stream
tables/blobs
tables/scalars
tables/maps
tables/lists
tables/arms
tables/backend
tables/vocab
tables/vocab9
